    "description": "There is currently a security alert for this plugin, but the SECURITY-2404 issue is still private.\n\nIs work being done on it? Can a fix be expected any time soon?",
    "issuelinks": [],
    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.jenkins.io/rest/api/2/issue/216321/comment/429053",
          "id": "429053",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.jenkins.io/rest/api/2/user?username=markewaite",
            "name": "markewaite",
            "key": "markewaite",
